{"task_id": "HumanEval/46", "solution": "```python\ndef fib4(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the n-th Fib4 number using an iterative approach.\n    It stores and reuses previously computed values to ensure efficiency.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    if n == 1:\n        return 0\n    if n == 2:\n        return 2\n    if n == 3:\n        return 0\n\n    # Initialize the list with the first four base cases\n    fib_values = [0, 0, 2, 0]\n\n    # Iterate from the 4th element up to n\n    for i in range(4, n + 1):\n        next_fib = fib_values[i-1] + fib_values[i-2] + fib_values[i-3] + fib_values[i-4]\n        fib_values.append(next_fib)\n\n    return fib_values[n]\n```"}
