{"task_id": "HumanEval/63", "solution": "```python\n_fibfib_memo = {\n    0: 0,\n    1: 0,\n    2: 1\n}\n\ndef fibfib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"The FibFib number sequence. Uses memoization to efficiently compute the n-th element.\"\"\"\n    if n in _fibfib_memo:\n        return _fibfib_memo[n]\n\n    # Calculate fibfib(n) recursively and store the result in memo for future use.\n    result = fibfib(n - 1) + fibfib(n - 2) + fibfib(n - 3)\n    _fibfib_memo[n] = result\n    return result\n```"}
