{"task_id": "HumanEval/70", "solution": "```python\ndef strange_sort_list(lst):\n    '''\n    Given list of integers, return list in strange order.\n    Starts with min, then max of remaining, then min, and so on.\n    '''\n    if not lst:\n        return []\n\n    sorted_list = sorted(lst)\n    result_list = []\n    left_ptr = 0\n    right_ptr = len(sorted_list) - 1\n    is_min_turn = True\n\n    while left_ptr <= right_ptr:\n        if is_min_turn:\n            result_list.append(sorted_list[left_ptr])\n            left_ptr += 1\n        else:\n            result_list.append(sorted_list[right_ptr])\n            right_ptr -= 1\n        is_min_turn = not is_min_turn\n\n    return result_list\n```"}
